TI  - A dimension-stone-specific GIS-AHP framework for regional quarry suitability screening in under-mapped Precambrian basement: application to Cameroon’s West Region, Central African Fold Belt
AU  - Bertrand Tatoh Aziwo
AU  - Cheo Emmanuel Suh
AU  - Olivier Anoh Njoh
AU  - Ernest Tata Tata
