TI  - BITUMEN STABILIZED LATERITIC SOIL REINFORCED WITH GRANITE POWDER AND RECYCLED STEEL FIBER AS BASE MATERIAL IN ROAD CONSTRUCTION
AU  - ALOKEE Nekabari
AU  - Oba Achemie Lewis
PY  - 2026
JO  - World Journal of Advanced Engineering Technology and Sciences
DO  - 10.30574/wjaets.2026.20.3.0444
