TI  - Gabbro as a sustainable geomaterial platform: a comprehensive review of environmental applications, carbon mineralization, and circular resource utilization
AU  - Mostafa R. Abukhadra
AU  - Hassan A. Rudayni
AU  - Ahmed A. Allam
AU  - Bahaa Eldin Mahmoud Amin
PY  - 2026
JO  - Environmental Earth Sciences
