TI  - Fly ash-cement compositions modified by complex sulfate- carbonate admixture and fine grained concretes on their basis
AU  - Serhii Durytskyi
AU  - Vitaly Pavliuk
PY  - 2025
JO  - Transfer of innovative technologies
DO  - 10.32347/tit.2024.7.2.01.02
