TI  - Respirable dust and respirable crystalline silica exposures among workers at stone countertop fabrication shops in Georgia from 2017 through 2023
AU  - Jhy‐Charm Soo
AU  - Jenny L. Houlroyd
AU  - Hilarie Warren
AU  - Brandon J Philpot
